	"FriendlyName": "Segmented Splines",
	"Description": "Drag a belt, pipe, hypertube or railway past its length limit and build it with one click: the mod splits the curve you aimed for into legal pieces and builds them one after another, with supports at the joints and a length and section-count readout while you drag. Client-side only; works on vanilla dedicated servers.",
